# Vue 2 Frontend Rules

## Components

- Options API only (`export default { data(), methods, mounted() }`)
- Main chat UI: `resources/assets/js/components/PrivateChat.vue`
- Use existing axios, Laravel Echo, Pusher patterns in `bootstrap.js`

## Real-time

- Private chat: channel `privatechat.{receiver_id}`
- Report summary: end simulation redirect — see `.cursor/features/report-summary.md`

## Build

```bash
npm install
npm run production
```

## Do not

- Convert to Vue 3 or Composition API
- Add new build tooling (Vite, etc.)
- Change webpack config unless required for the feature
